WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.046
India passed its data protection

2
00:00:03.046 --> 00:00:04.095
law in 2023.

3
00:00:04.376 --> 00:00:07.075
Most of it still isn't in force.

4
00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:10.167
It gives you, the Data Principal, rights:

5
00:00:10.343 --> 00:00:12.254
to access your data, correct

6
00:00:12.254 --> 00:00:13.073
or erase it,

7
00:00:13.330 --> 00:00:15.531
seek redress, and nominate someone.

8
00:00:15.815 --> 00:00:17.874
Whoever decides why and how

9
00:00:17.874 --> 00:00:19.552
your data is processed

10
00:00:19.812 --> 00:00:21.502
is a Data Fiduciary, and

11
00:00:21.502 --> 00:00:23.051
owes you those duties.

12
00:00:23.338 --> 00:00:25.007
But the Act lets the government

13
00:00:25.007 --> 00:00:26.354
switch on different parts

14
00:00:26.354 --> 00:00:27.377
on different dates.

15
00:00:27.593 --> 00:00:29.986
The rules came in November 2025.

16
00:00:30.601 --> 00:00:32.279
The Data Protection Board

17
00:00:32.279 --> 00:00:33.689
part started at once.

18
00:00:34.013 --> 00:00:35.908
Consent managers come a year later.

19
00:00:36.404 --> 00:00:38.403
Most duties, after 18 months:

20
00:00:38.778 --> 00:00:40.207
around May 2027.

21
00:00:40.554 --> 00:00:41.439
The rights are written.

22
00:00:41.832 --> 00:00:42.993
The rules set the clock.

23
00:00:43.205 --> 00:00:43.758
Your turn.

24
00:00:44.419 --> 00:00:45.724
Who is a Data Fiduciary?
